    "comment": "Hash input, exactly.\ndocumentNamespace = https://spdx.org/spdxdocs/<org>/<repo>/<identity>\nidentity = _projection(doc, drop_created=False)\nindex (finds a recurrence) = _projection(doc, drop_created=True)\ncreated is resolved first, then hashed.\n\ndef _projection(doc, drop_created):\n    d = {k: v for k, v in doc.items() if k != \"documentNamespace\"}\n    if drop_created:      # the INDEX drops it; the IDENTITY never does\n        d[\"creationInfo\"] = {k: v for k, v in d[\"creationInfo\"].items() if k != \"created\"}\n    d[\"packages\"]      = sorted(doc.get(\"packages\", []),\n                                key=lambda p: (p.get(\"SPDXID\",\"\"), p.get(\"name\",\"\")))\n    d[\"relationships\"] = sorted(doc.get(\"relationships\", []),\n                                key=lambda r: (r.get(\"spdxElementId\",\"\"),\n                                               r.get(\"relationshipType\",\"\"),\n                                               r.get(\"relatedSpdxElement\",\"\")))\n    blob = json.dumps(d, separators=(\",\", \":\"), sort_keys=True, ensure_ascii=False)\n    return hashlib.sha256(blob.encode(\"utf-8\")).hexdigest()\n\nSource: gh api repos/<org>/<repo>/dependency-graph/sbom --jq .sbom",
